            "<p>Express a lot in few words; concise expression</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>घर का भेदी लंका ढाए</p>",
            "<p>Insider betrayal is most dangerous</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>चिकना घड़ा होना</p>",
            "<p>Shameless; nothing affects; Teflon-like unaffected</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>टेढ़ी खीर होना</p>",
            "<p>Very difficult task</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>दाल में काला होना</p>",
            "<p>Something suspicious; something fishy</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>नमक मिर्च लगाना</p>",
            "<p>Exaggerate; add spice to news</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>पानी पानी होना</p>",
            "<p>Feel extremely ashamed; embarrassed</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>बात का धनी होना</p>",
            "<p>Person who keeps their word; reliable</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>मुंह में पानी आना</p>",
            "<p>Mouth watering; eager desire</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>राई का पहाड़ बनाना</p>",
            "<p>Make a mountain out of a molehill; exaggerate</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>लोहे के चने चबाना</p>",
            "<p>Face extremely difficult task</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>हाथ पर हाथ धरे बैठना</p>",
            "<p>Sit idle; do nothing</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>आँखें खुलना</p>",
            "<p>To realise; to become aware of reality</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>कमर कसना</p>",
            "<p>Prepare fully for a task; brace oneself</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>नाक में दम करना</p>",
            "<p>Cause great trouble; irritate constantly</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>पत्थर पर दूब उगाना</p>",
            "<p>Achieve impossible task</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "wtiqa2i",
