      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Lokokti</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Meaning</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>अकेला चना भाड़ नहीं फोड़ता</p>",
            "<p>One person cannot accomplish big task alone</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>अब पछताए होत क्या जब चिड़ियाँ चुग गईं खेत</p>",
            "<p>No point regretting after harm is done</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>आ बैल मुझे मार</p>",
            "<p>Inviting trouble willingly</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>अंधे के आगे रोए, दोनों आँखें खोए</p>",
            "<p>Wasting time on insensitive or unworthy person</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>ऊँचे दुकान, फीकी पकवान</p>",
            "<p>High reputation but inferior product/service</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>एक और एक ग्यारह होते हैं</p>",
            "<p>Unity is strength; united we are stronger</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>कहीं की ईंट कहीं का रोड़ा, भानुमती ने कुनबा जोड़ा</p>",
            "<p>Mismatched combination assembled without logic</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>खग जाने खग की भाषा</p>",
            "<p>Like knows like; birds of a feather</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>चोर की दाढ़ी में तिनका</p>",
            "<p>Guilty person becomes nervous at slightest mention</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>जिस थाली में खाना उसी में छेद करना</p>",
            "<p>Harm the one who feeds you; betray benefactor</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>नाच न जाने आँगन टेढ़ा</p>",
            "<p>Blame circumstances for own incompetence</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>बंदर क्या जाने अदरक का स्वाद</p>",
            "<p>Cannot appreciate what one has no experience of</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>मन चंगा तो कठौती में गंगा</p>",
            "<p>If heart is pure, God is everywhere; faith matters</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>सौ सुनार की, एक लुहार की</p>",
            "<p>One strong blow is worth a hundred weak ones</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>हाथ कंगन को आरसी क्या</p>",
            "<p>Self-evident truth needs no proof</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
